Your packages really have everything.

870
00:40:53,320 --> 00:40:54,280
But...

871
00:40:54,280 --> 00:40:57,120
my father-in-law was a very frugal man.

872
00:40:59,560 --> 00:41:00,640
Brother,

873
00:41:00,640 --> 00:41:01,960
that's where you're wrong.

874
00:41:01,960 --> 00:41:04,160
Precisely because your father was frugal,

875
00:41:04,520 --> 00:41:05,960
as his children,

876
00:41:05,960 --> 00:41:08,120
how can you let him suffer after death?

877
00:41:08,840 --> 00:41:10,280
If you don't show filial piety now,

878
00:41:10,280 --> 00:41:11,560
when are you going to do it?

879
00:41:12,400 --> 00:41:13,120
Right?

880
00:41:13,960 --> 00:41:17,080
Is that so?

881
00:41:18,240 --> 00:41:18,920
Yeah.

882
00:41:19,520 --> 00:41:21,240
I suppose that's true,

883
00:41:21,240 --> 00:41:22,120
but...

884
00:41:22,520 --> 00:41:24,040
We've also launched a

885
00:41:24,040 --> 00:41:26,120
mini-app for the Filial Piety Leaderboard.

886
00:41:26,120 --> 00:41:26,840
Look.

887
00:41:28,120 --> 00:41:29,840
It's called Ronghua.

888
00:41:30,240 --> 00:41:32,360
It's full of very dutiful children.

889
00:41:32,840 --> 00:41:34,600
The top ten on the list

890
00:41:34,600 --> 00:41:35,880
are all incredibly filial.

891
00:41:36,840 --> 00:41:37,920
Tell you what.

892
00:41:37,920 --> 00:41:39,640
I feel a connection with you two.

893
00:41:39,640 --> 00:41:41,120
I'll make the call today.

894
00:41:41,120 --> 00:41:42,360
If you sign the contract today,

895
00:41:43,000 --> 00:41:46,680
I guarantee you'll shoot into the top ten.

896
00:41:48,640 --> 00:41:50,160
You'll have plenty of prestige.

897
00:41:50,640 --> 00:41:52,400
And your father over there

898
00:41:52,400 --> 00:41:54,200
will have so much face.

899
00:41:54,200 --> 00:41:54,880
Right?

900
00:41:55,360 --> 00:41:56,960
This sales pitch...

901
00:41:56,960 --> 00:41:58,880
I have to admit defeat.

902
00:42:02,040 --> 00:42:02,520
Mr. Wang.

903
00:42:02,520 --> 00:42:02,920
I...

904
00:42:02,920 --> 00:42:03,440
Mr. Wang.

905
00:42:05,160 --> 00:42:06,000
We've decided.

906
00:42:06,400 --> 00:42:09,040
We'll take the Imperial Premium Package.

907
00:42:09,040 --> 00:42:09,840
See that?

908
00:42:09,840 --> 00:42:11,040
They decided right away.

909
00:42:11,040 --> 00:42:12,120
You two need to hurry,

910
00:42:12,320 --> 00:42:13,480
or there won't be any spots left.

911
00:42:15,080 --> 00:42:16,800
There's no need to waste this money.

912
00:42:17,560 --> 00:42:18,440
He's not your biological father,

913
00:42:18,440 --> 00:42:19,840
so of course you think it's unnecessary!

914
00:42:20,160 --> 00:42:21,600
Mr. Wang said it himself.

915
00:42:21,600 --> 00:42:23,040
Filial piety is the greatest virtue.

916
00:42:23,400 --> 00:42:25,360
I'm going to give my dad a grand funeral!

917
00:42:25,760 --> 00:42:27,120
And get into the top ten

918
00:42:27,120 --> 00:42:28,200
of the Filial Piety Leaderboard!

919
00:42:29,320 --> 00:42:31,040
Don't think I don't know your intentions.

920
00:42:31,360 --> 00:42:33,200
You just want to brag in front of others!

921
00:42:34,360 --> 00:42:35,560
You stupid woman!

922
00:42:35,560 --> 00:42:36,440
Let me tell you,

923
00:42:36,720 --> 00:42:39,240
this funeral must be a grand affair!

924
00:42:39,240 --> 00:42:40,160
It's non-negotiable!

925
00:42:40,560 --> 00:42:41,920
It's 180,000!

926
00:42:41,920 --> 00:42:43,640
How are we supposed to live?

927
00:42:43,640 --> 00:42:44,320
Let's get a divorce!

928
00:42:45,680 --> 00:42:46,800
You dare threaten me?

929
00:42:47,200 --> 00:42:47,840
You stupid woman!

930
00:42:47,840 --> 00:42:50,120
Um, your father just passed away.

931
00:42:50,360 --> 00:42:52,040
It's not appropriate to fight now.

932
00:42:52,640 --> 00:42:53,600
Please accept my condolences.

933
00:42:57,160 --> 00:42:57,960
Just ignore her.

934
00:42:57,960 --> 00:42:58,840
I'll come by myself tomorrow.

935
00:42:59,320 --> 00:43:00,240
It's fine, it's fine.

936
00:43:00,240 --> 00:43:01,200
I'll walk you out.

937
00:43:04,040 --> 00:43:05,480
What a truly filial son.

938
00:43:05,760 --> 00:43:06,800
I'm telling you,

939
00:43:06,800 --> 00:43:07,560
you must come tomorrow!

940
00:43:07,560 --> 00:43:08,720
I'm sorry.

941
00:43:08,720 --> 00:43:10,000
Sorry you had to see that.

942
00:43:10,960 --> 00:43:11,680
Ma'am! Ma'am!

943
00:43:11,680 --> 00:43:12,200
Wait a moment.

944
00:43:15,480 --> 00:43:17,160
If you need anything,

945
00:43:17,160 --> 00:43:18,240
contact me anytime.

946
00:43:23,560 --> 00:43:24,560
What is this?

947
00:43:26,640 --> 00:43:27,680
What do you mean?

948
00:43:27,680 --> 00:43:28,720
You're stealing my business, huh?

949
00:43:29,200 --> 00:43:30,320
What the...

950
00:43:30,320 --> 00:43:32,240
I knew something was off with you two.

951
00:43:32,720 --> 00:43:34,760
You came here to steal my business!

952
00:43:38,040 --> 00:43:38,840
Mr. Wang,

953
00:43:39,680 --> 00:43:41,760
we took a look at your packages.

954
00:43:42,440 --> 00:43:44,960
We think this package

955
00:43:44,960 --> 00:43:46,320
is indeed very nice.

956
00:43:46,720 --> 00:43:47,920
So we've decided...

957
00:43:49,200 --> 00:43:49,760
Hurry up! Let's go!

958
00:43:50,360 --> 00:43:51,080
Don't run!

959
00:43:51,560 --> 00:43:52,240
Stop right there!

960
00:43:52,760 --> 00:43:53,360
Stop!

961
00:43:54,560 --> 00:43:55,240
Don't run!

962
00:43:55,400 --> 00:43:55,840
Hurry!

963
00:44:02,400 --> 00:44:03,280
Stop!
